{"title":"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Kaleana shows her test score to Quay, Marty and Shana, but the others keep theirs hidden. Quay thinks, \"At least two of us have the same score.\" Marty thinks, \"I didn't get the lowest score.\" Shana thinks, \"I didn't get the highest score.\" List the scores from lowest to highest for Marty (M), Quay (Q) and Shana (S).\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/6/186a9ef15645df5d37d6b66dc5c17db6493b3ef8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\text{S,Q,M} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\text{Q,M,S} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\text{Q,S,M} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\text{M,S,Q} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{S,M,Q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"517\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the only other score Quay knows is Kaleana's, and he knows that two of them have the same score, Quay and Kaleana must have the same score, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/5/3b5517bda01b522da24654a1b7757f3e39e118be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K=Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" />. Marty knows that he didn't get the lowest score, and the only other score he knows is Kaleana's, so Marty must know that Kaleana must have a lower score than him, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee579eb9705e1319c6c3ab461f8fa826b8584b82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M&gt;K$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />. Finally, Shana knows that she didn't get the highest score, and the only other score she knows is Kaleana's, so Shana must know that Kaleana must have a higher score than her, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/c/a5c1b777510a5caa50e7dfc4ce04a052aceba79f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S&lt;K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />. Putting these together and substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/4/f64f39fe4e6f15f4f5157e37de402d6cf4f58118.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S&lt;Q&lt;M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" />, and from least to greatest this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/a/38aa7669b7381742bd4db57eb7c5fe7b14bb1160.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{S, Q, M}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" />, therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79e0e8ce41b5c08729443bcc258d13ca061ff35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8\" title=\"2001 AMC 8\">2001 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2001\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_P